<title>USA: Cardinal Health shares sold by MEDIQ.</title>
<headline>Cardinal Health shares sold by MEDIQ.</headline>
<dateline>PENNSAUKEN, N.J. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>MEDIQ Inc said Monday it sold an additonal 200,000 shares of Cardinal Health Inc for an aggregate $12,396,000.</p>
<p>As a result, MEDIQ said it completed the sale of all 1.449 million shares of Cardinal it had received upon the sale of MEDIQ's interest in PCI Servies Inc to Cardinal on Oct 11, 1996.</p>
<p>On Jan 23, MEDIQ said it sold 1.2 million shares of Cardinal Health for an aggregate $76 million.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale of the Cardinal shares were used to reduce borrowings under MEDIQ's credit facility, MEDIQ said.</p>
